title: date_tsuru_3_intro
location: training grounds
---

Overtime at the HQ training grounds!
During the last week, so much work piled up! But now you're finally finished and working out to blow off some steam and remember what not being stuck at a desk feels like.
{$name}: Pant... pant...
You haven't moved like this for a while... but you bet you can push it a bit.
Movement catches your eye. You squint under the evening light at the gates. Is somebody there?
{$name}: Oh! Vice Admiral Tsuru.
Tsuru: Ah, hello, {$name}. I didn't want to interrupt you.
-> It's good you're here! Do you want to train with me?
    Tsuru: Well... I have someone visiting.
    Tsuru: I was only going to pick something up before leaving again.
    -> Oh, don't worry about it!
        Tsuru: Hmm...
    -> {$name}: It's a shame, but I understand.
        <<set $td3_points +=1>>
        Tsuru: Aw. I can see you're disappointed.
    Tsuru looks at the time.
    Tsuru: Hm... I'm sure she will understand.
    Tsuru: How long do you need me, {$name}?
    Tsuru: It's only fair, after how much you've done for me.
    -> I'm almost done here!
        <<jump date_tsuru_3_training_route_stretch>>
    -> I'd like to ask you for advice on my Haki training.
        <<jump date_tsuru_3_training_route_haki>>
-> I was almost finished anyway...
        Tsuru: Well, then.
        Tsuru: Don't forget to stretch.
        Tsuru: Do you need to go up to the office again? I can wait for you, but not too long— I have a visitor.
        -> Could you help me end the workout?
            <<jump date_tsuru_3_training_route_stretch>>
        -> Nope! You can go home.
            Tsuru: Alright.
            <<jump date_tsuru_3_early_end0>>
===

title: date_tsuru_3_early_end0
location: training grounds
---

Tsuru: Don't tire yourself out too much, {$name}.
{$name}: (Uh oh... That didn't go too well.)
You should've known by now that Tsuru expects you to be honest... and you really could have used her guidance. Hopefully you won't be too sore tomorrow...
===

title: date_tsuru_3_training_route_stretch
location: training grounds
---

Tsuru: Hmm! I see that you have been working hard!
Tsuru: It's important to decompress the whole body after an intense training session.
What would you like to do next?
-> Grind a bit more and pack up!
    <<set $td3_points -=1>>
    Tsuru: {$name} I hope you know your limits...
    Tsuru: You need to take care of yourself.
    Tsuru is poking at you gently to get on the stretching mat.
-> Just go home. Sprains are for the weak!
    <<set $td3_points -=1>>
    Tsuru: {$name}, you're reminding me of Garp...
    Tsuru: But you're not quite allowed to be as irresponsible as he is yet.
    Tsuru is poking at you to gently get on the stretching mat.
-> Stretch before leaving!
    <<set $td3_points +=1>>
    Tsuru: Good, good.
    Tsuru: A good Marine knows how to take care of themselves.
Tsuru: Here.
As you stretch your legs and hips, Tsuru places her hands on your back and gives you a slight push.
-> Do 10 seconds...
    <<set $td3_points -=1>>
    Tsuru: What? That was it?
-> Do 20 seconds...
    <<set $td3_points -=1>>
    Tsuru: That was it?
-> Do 30 seconds...
    <<set $td3_points +=1>>
    Tsuru: I think that's enough!
Tsuru: Here, I'll give you a hand.
-> Can you help me with massage? My muscles are really tight.
    <<set $td3_points +=1>>
    Tsuru: ...
    Is that a light blush you are noticing?
    Tsuru: ... Of course.
    You decompress as Tsuru sets her palms on yours.
    She massages your arms. Wherever she touches, you feel your skin cool down... Then warming up. Comfort envelops you, as if you were standing under running water.
    Tsuru: My Devil Fruit doesn't only come in handy in battle.
    <<jump date_tsuru_3_talking_route2>>
-> I'll take care of it from now on!
    Tsuru: As you wish, {$name}.
    <<jump date_tsuru_3_early_end>>
===

title: date_tsuru_3_training_route_haki
location: training grounds
---

{$name}: I was wondering about the next steps to activate my Haki.
{$name}: ...I hope that's not too overconfident of me.
Tsuru: Oh. I always have some time to help you.
Tsuru: It is very nice to see you are ambitious, {$name}!
You follow Tsuru to a sheltered area within the training grounds, where a few slings and straps are hanging from a rack.
Tsuru: So... Does this ring a bell from your training, {$name}?
{$name}: Oh, sure!
Tsuru: Very good! So you know what you have to do!
{$name}: ...
-> I suppose... I have to swing from one of these slings to the other.
    <<set $td3_points -=1>>
    You start climbing up the structure.
    Tsuru: {$name}? What are you doing?
    Tsuru: I thought you said you know what this is...
    Tsuru: Sigh... There is no stopping boldness.
    Tsuru: You should find out what this exercise is, okay? That is your homework for now.
    {$name}: Wait...
    She has left by the time you get back on the ground.
    <<jump date_tsuru_3_early_end>>
-> I'm not sure...
    <<set $td3_points +=1>>
    You think there is a piece missing here.
    Tsuru: Exactly! You're a good observer, {$name}.
-> Tsuru... Could you remind me what I am supposed to do?
    Tsuru: Of course.
Tsuru fetches a long cloth. After a few loops and tugs, it hangs from the hinges like a hammock.
Tsuru: I will demonstrate.
Swiftly, Tsuru twirls around the cloth and hangs upside-down, her gray hair dangling in a ponytail, her smile wide.
She is perfectly balanced, with a grace you wouldn't expect at her age.
{$name}: Wow!
Tsuru tilts one way, then the other. Then she unfurls around the cloth, back to the ground.
Tsuru: First the right leg, then shifting your balance, kick your left leg up!
Tsuru: Well, what do you think? Can you do this?
-> No way. Let's do something easier.
    <<set $td3_points -=1>>
    Tsuru: Pushing yourself is important for the development of Haki.
    Tsuru: Maybe this is the next step you need to take before you can hone it.
    <<jump date_tsuru_3_early_end1>>
-> Of course!
    Tsuru: That's the spirit!
    Tsuru: Your task is to try to imitate me.
    She gives you a little wink.
    Tsuru: Shouldn't be a problem, as confident as you are...
    {$name}: (What was that, again?)
    -> Kick your left leg up, then shift your balance.
        <<set $td3_points -=1>>
        Tsuru: Careful {$name}—
        *CRASH*
        Tsuru: Oh my. Are you alright?
        Tsuru: That can happen when you aren't paying attention...
        Tsuru: I'm afraid you were facing the wrong way.
        -> I'm so sorry! I'll do better!
            <<set $td3_points +=1>>
            Tsuru: That's the spirit...
            Tsuru: But you aren't hurt, are you?
            Tsuru: Let me see.
        -> Would it have killed you to tell me before?!
            <<set $td3_points -=1>>
            Tsuru: Concentration is a very important part of learning Haki, so I assumed...
            Tsuru: ...Maybe I should have told you to be more careful.
            Tsuru: Are you hurt?
            You sit up and, gently, Tsuru places her hands on your back. Your skin cools down, then warms up. Comfort envelops you as if you were standing under running water.
            Tsuru: My Devil's Fruit doesn't only come in handy in battle.
            Tsuru: I hope you're feeling better now.
            -> (Say nothing.)
                Tsuru: ...
            -> I am. Thank you.
                Tsuru: Very good.
            -> I could get used to this...
                <<set $td3_points +=1>>
                Tsuru stays silent.
                Is that a bit of a blush that you're seeing?
                Tsuru: Well...
            Tsuru: Would you like to try again?
            -> Yes.
                Without waiting for her to prompt you, you get on your feet and back to the aerial pose. Kicking first the left leg up, then shifting your balance, and then...
                <<jump date_tsuru_3_haki_choices_again>>
            -> No.
                Tsuru: It's OK. I know this week has been challenging. {$name}, I suppose that's some homework for you. Master your concentration before aiming higher... That's the next step in your journey.
                <<jump date_tsuru_3_early_end2>>
    -> Kick your right leg up, then shift your balance.
        <<set $td3_points +=1>>
        Tsuru: Very well! I'm impressed.
        Tsuru: And now...
        -> Kick your right leg up.
            You follow Tsuru's instructions. You twist and twirl in the air.
            You feel your pulse in your throat.
            Tsuru: Excellent, {$name}!
            Tsuru: Now close your eyes...
            (=> training_route_sparring)
        -> Panic from the pressure.
            Tsuru: Are we doing OK, here?
            -> No.
                <<set $td3_points +=1>>
                To your surprise, Tsuru laughs.
                Tsuru: Come back down, then.
                Tsuru: This has been enough for today.
                <<jump date_tsuru_3_early_end2>>
            -> S-sure...
                Tsuru: Well, then!
                <<jump date_tsuru_3_haki_choices_again>>
        -> Shift again.
            Tsuru: Be caref—
            *CRASH*
            Tsuru: Oh my. Are you okay?
            Tsuru: That can happen when you aren't quite paying attention...
            Tsuru: I'm afraid you were facing the wrong way.
            -> I'm so sorry! I'll do better!
                <<set $td3_points +=1>>
                Tsuru: That's the spirit...
                Tsuru: But you aren't hurt, are you?
                Tsuru: Let me see.
            -> Would it have killed you to tell me before?!
                <<set $td3_points -=1>>
                Tsuru: Concentration is a very important step to activating your Haki, so I assumed...
                Tsuru: Maybe I should have told you to be more careful.
                Tsuru: Are you hurt?
            You sit up and, gently, Tsuru places her hands on your back.
            Your body stirs as she starts to massage you. She seems to leave a cool, smooth trail wherever she touches you through your clothes.
            As if you were standing under running water, comfort envelops you.
            Tsuru: ...You were doing well, {$name}.
            -> Say nothing.
                Tsuru: ...
            -> Thanks...
                <<set $td3_points +=1>>
            Tsuru: Would you like to try again?
            -> Yes.
                Without waiting for her to prompt you, you get on your feet and back to the aerial pose. Kicking first the left leg up, then shifting your balance, and then...
                <<jump date_tsuru_3_haki_choices_again>>
            -> No.
                Tsuru: Oh. Well... OK.
                Tsuru: Then... Would you like to come have tea with me?
                Tsuru: I suppose... I have a few more minutes.
                <<jump date_tsuru_3_talking_route2>>
===

