title: date_tsuru_3_early_end
location: training grounds
---

{$name}: Well, that didn't go too well...
{$name}: By now, it figures that Tsuru prefers it when I'm honest about my abilities...
===

title: date_tsuru_3_early_end1
location: training grounds
---

The Vice Admiral leaves as you finish putting away equipment.
{$name}: Well, that didn't go too well...
{$name}: I should have paid more attention.
===

title: date_tsuru_3_early_end2
location: training grounds
---

She leaves as you finish putting equipment away.
{$name}: That could have gone better...
{$name}: But did...did she want to spend more time with me?
You feel a tiny bubble of hope in your chest as you head home.
===

title: date_tsuru_3_training_route_sparring
location: training grounds
---

You are hanging upside-down.
It's... kind of cool, if you say so yourself.
Tsuru: Very good!
Tsuru: Well... I think you are ready to aim a little bit higher, dear {$name}.
Tsuru: Do you think you can defend yourself... With your eyes shut?
-> Yes!
    <<set $td3_points +=1>>
    Tsuru: Excellent!
-> Um...
    Tsuru: Only if you're confident enough... But I think you should be.
Following her command, you close your eyes.
You are investing all of your concentration in trying to stay put, in keeping this balance.
Tsuru: Now. Just so we are on the same page.
Tsuru: I will pick up a training sword now.
{$name}: ...
Tsuru: It's difficult to describe how Haki works, but, based on the experience of my disciples...
Tsuru: Try to not focus in the body, but in the space outside of it. It might seem empty, but it is not. You will feel my motions in the air around you.
Tsuru: Regard your own reactions as if they were a part of it...
Tsuru: And the moment, as a state that you can slip in and out of...
Tsuru: Did I make myself understood?
-> Yes. I understood.
    <<set $td3_points +=1>>
-> Um... I'm a bit scared now.
    <<set $td3_points -=1>>
    Tsuru: Ah, {$name}!
    Tsuru: You're not trying to sneak out of it now. Are you?
-> Let's say I did.
    Tsuru shakes her head and chuckles.
    Tsuru: Ah, {$name}.
    Tsuru: Then let us try, at least.
You close your eyes. Feel every beat of your body, your very core pumping blood into your extremities. Breathing is the key to controlling your body.
Without moving, you try to grasp... To *perceive* everything that is around you.
-> Say nothing. Put all of your concentration into this.
    <<set $td3_points +=1>>
    Silence. Your heart beats with anticipation.
    The first cut ripples through the air and you jerk to the side, feeling the air ripple on the skin of your cheek...!
    But... you dodged it!
    Tsuru: Excellent, {$name}.
-> Say something to try and make Tsuru react.
    {$name}: Vice Admiral Tsuru! When are you attacking?
    She doesn't answer, of course. But you haven't lost your concentration either.
    -> Say something again.
        <<set $td3_points +=1>>
        {$name}: Tsu—
        The first cut ripples through the air and you jerk to the side, feeling the air buzz against the skin of your cheek.
        But... You dodged it!
        Tsuru: Excellent, {$name}.
    -> Prepare for an attack.
        <<set $td3_points -=1>>
        The anticipation is making your heart race. You fend for her aura in the darkness, but...There is nothing.
        You begin to sweat. She's making you ner—
        The training sword stabs into the space between your suspended limbs.
        You open your eyes, groaning.
        Tsuru: Did your nerves get the best of you, {$name}?
A string of attacks follow her words, slicing into the air. Some of them, you dodge. Others you don't.
-> Stay with your eyes closed. Stick to the training!
    <<set $td3_points +=1>>
    Tsuru: Very good!
    Tsuru's attacks persevere. They get more intense, quicker and stronger, barely letting you rest. You find yourself exhausted, your muscles strained.
    Is it possible that you're starting to perceive something?!
    -> It could very well be!
        <<set $td3_points +=1>>
        {$name}: I think this is it! It's happening!
        Tsuru smiles at you.
        Tsuru: It would truly be great if Haki could be activated after only one training session... But you'd have to do this a few times more, {$name}.
        Tsuru: But I do believe that you've noticed a pattern in my attacks. You're very bright.
        Tsuru narrows her eyes fondly.
        Tsuru: You've done very well.
    -> No, you're simply feeling on edge and exhausted.
        Tsuru pauses. When you open your eyes, although you're upside down... She is narrowing her eyes fondly.
        Tsuru: I'm proud of your effort. You did very well.
    -> It's too intense. Stop.
        {$name}: It's -pant- it's too much!
        Tsuru: Alright, dear {$name}. You did very well.
Tsuru: Now, come down.
You obey, chest rising and falling, heart in your throat.
Tsuru: Be proud of what you achieved today...
Tsuru: And, if you'd like... We could do this more often.
{$name}: Yes! Of course!
<<jump date_tsuru_3_hakiEnd>>
===

title: date_tsuru_3_talking_route2
location: office
---

The offices and corridors of New Marineford change when you're almost alone. The evening light turns them orange.
You sit in Tsuru's office, nursing a warm cup of herbal tea.
Tsuru: What is better than tea and wonderful company after training?
-> Thank you, it's delicious!
    Tsuru clears her throat.
    Tsuru: You're welcome.
-> Did you say wonderful?
    <<set $td3_points +=1>>
    You feel your cheeks go aflame... And maybe she is smiling a little bit too?
Tsuru: I have to admit, {$name}... It has been a long week.
Tsuru: To see your will to improve is quite inspiring.
-> It's so nice of you to take the time to help me!
    <<set $td3_points +=1>>
    Tsuru:...
    Tsuru: I know I'm not your mentor, but I like to see potential realized.
    Tsuru: I see it quite often with my cadets; all that is missing is the right sort of motivation. As you know, I often take women under my wing.
    Tsuru: It can be difficult to be taken seriously in this institution.
-> Well, I have to push myself if I'm working alongside the best!
    <<set $td3_points -=1>>
    Tsuru: That is all very well. However...
    Tsuru: I would advise you to not put anybody on a pedestal. Sengoku, Garp, and I... Even a hero such as Rosinante... We are all only human.
    Tsuru: Many fail to understand that.
-> (You don't know what to say.)
    Tsuru: As shy as ever..
    Tsuru: Some things don't change.
You realize that time is going by. Doesn't Tsuru have an appointment with somebody?
Shouldn't that be about *now*?
-> Weren't you meeting somebody soon?
    <<set $td3_points +=1>>
    Tsuru: Ah! Time flies.
    Tsuru: Yes, {$name}.
    Tsuru: My granddaughter, Kujaku, is coming to visit.
    Tsuru: Do you know the Marines from SWORD, in the G-7?
    -> I have heard about them!
        <<set $td3_points +=1>>
        Tsuru: Yes, then you have probably heard about my granddaughter. She is quite wild, but I'm proud of what she has achieved.
    -> No idea who they are!
        Tsuru: Oh... I forgot that you haven't been here for very long. I have a granddaughter. She is quite wild, but I'm proud of what she has achieved.
    -> What? You have a granddaughter?
        <<set $td3_points -=1>>
        Tsuru: Yes! What's so strange about that?
        {$name}: (Ugh, that came out wrong...)
    Tsuru: Well... Yes, that's who I'm meeting today.
    Tsuru: Since she spends most of her time in the G-7 base, taking care of her Rear Admiral duties, we don't usually have much time together.
    -> Wow! Your grandkid is a Rear Admiral? That's awesome!
        <<set $td3_points +=1>>
    -> SWORD? Well, I suppose Garp's grandson is quite rebellious too...
        <<set $td3_points -=1>>
        Tsuru: What–? I mean...
        Tsuru: Please do not compare a Rear Admiral with those pirates.
    Tsuru: Today, we are catching up. But you're invited to meet her the next time, if you'd like.
    {$name}: (!)
    {$name}: O-OK...
    <<jump date_tsuru_3_trueEnd>>
-> Say nothing... Stay with her longer.
    Tsuru: Ah. But it is getting late for me now.
    {$name}: (Aw...)
    Tsuru: It was nice to see you today, dear {$name}.
    Tsuru: But I have some obligations... So, see you next time.
    <<jump date_tsuru_3_trueEnd2>>
===

title: date_tsuru_3_hakiEnd
location: quarters
---

Wow, it was so cool to train with Lady Tsuru... maybe one day you'll even develop your haki under her tutelage...
You fall asleep imagining her proud smile.
===

title: date_tsuru_3_trueEnd
location: quarters
---

When you finally arrive home, you can't stop thinking about the Vice Admiral's words... would you really get to meet her family one day?
With a warm sigh, you drift off to sleep.
===

title: date_tsuru_3_trueEnd2
location: office
---

You watch the Vice Admiral leave and as the door shuts behind her, you notice a brand new pile of paperwork on your desk.
The work nevers ENDS!
===
